  "body": "Motivated vendor wants it SOLD! \r\n\r\nThis brand-new freehold contemporary family home is your ticket to a lifestyle of ease and convenience in one of the North Shore's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\n• Four good-sized bedrooms upstairs, including a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and an ensuite\r\n• Sun-filled open-plan living flows seamlessly to a deck and a fully fenced, landscaped garden\r\n• Modern designer kitchen with quality finishes and ample storage\r\n• Internal access single garage\r\n• Low-maintenance, perfect for busy lifestyles or lock-and-leave living\r\n• Zoned for Forrest Hill Primary, Takapuna Intermediate, and Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools, all within easy 10-minute walking distance\r\n• Steps to local cafés, parks, beaches, and public transport\r\n• Close proximity to North Shore Hospital and major amenities\r\n• Covered by 10-year Stamford New Build Insurance\r\n\r\nMotivated vendor wants it SOLD! \r\n\r\nThis brand-new contemporary family home is your ticket to a lifestyle of ease and convenience in one of the North Shore's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything here: walk to Milford Village, mall, beaches, cafes, and North Shore Hospital. Zoned for top schools including Forrest Hill Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, and both Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools - all just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nCall me now for your private viewing to take the first step toward your Milford dream.\r\n\r\nConjunctions from all Agents are welcome\r\n\r\nPlease note: Photos shown are from the show home at 37F Corunna Road",
